The only supported API's to the directory services are XDS and NSI.  This
is all that OSF documents.  There is an internal API to CDS called the
CDSPI which do not recommend people using.  We are likely to change it in
future releases.

Having said that.  If you still really want to use the CDSPI than you might
look in the techical supplement that OSF ships as postscript files for a
file called cdsapi.ps.  If you don't get this as part of your product, then
ask your vendor.  It's a large document describing the cdspi.

